[{"id":"addon:the_redeemer:hellshire_iron","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-19","title":"地狱郡烙铁","titleEn":null,"rarity":"ultra","description":["地狱郡黑帮的烙铁。虽然民间有各种各样的传说，但它并没有烙在新加入成员的身上，而是用来在特别嘴硬的悬赏目标的身上留下烙印。","·一名逃生者被矛枪命中时，获得无法侦测状态。此效果在逃生者逃脱矛枪后仍会持续10秒。","无法侦测状态会隐藏杀手的气场、恐惧范围与红光。"],"flavor":"“地狱郡黑帮：正义追寻者还是亡命之徒？”——格伦威尔公报头条","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_hellshireIron.webp","glyph":2,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Hellshire_Iron","pinyin":"diyujunlaotie","initials":"dyjlt"},{"id":"addon:the_redeemer:iridescent_coin","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-19","title":"荧虹硬币","titleEn":null,"rarity":"ultra","description":["由迷雾铸造出的玻璃状硬币。赏金猎人的酬劳已经结清。","·在12米外被矛枪命中的逃生者，在挣脱矛枪前将受到危险状态影响。","危险状态会使逃生者受到普通攻击时直接陷入濒死状态。"],"flavor":"“绝望中达成的交易将在疯狂中偿还。”","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_iridescentCoin.webp","glyph":3,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Iridescent_Coin","pinyin":"yinghongyingbi","initials":"yhyb"},{"id":"addon:the_redeemer:barbed_wire","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-19","title":"带刺铁丝","titleEn":null,"rarity":"very-rare","description":["可弯折的美国产铁丝，上面分布着锋利的倒刺。尽管朴实无华，凯勒布还是为它找到了妙用，将它缠绕在了矛枪上以增加伤害。","·逃生者缝合时间增加3.5秒。"],"flavor":"“恐惧终将消失。在那之前，恐惧我吧。”—凯勒布·奎因","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_barbedWire.webp","glyph":5,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Barbed_Wire","pinyin":"daicitiesi","initials":"dcts"},{"id":"addon:the_redeemer:prison_chain","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-19","title":"监狱锁链","titleEn":null,"rarity":"very-rare","description":["又粗又重的铁链，曾经一头拴着一个钢球，另一头拴在凯勒布的脚踝上。现在得到了改装，栓在了矛枪上。","·逃生者挣脱矛枪所需时间增加10%。"],"flavor":"“在监狱大院外工作的囚犯必须拴上至少16斤重的钢球。”——地狱郡监狱守卫手册","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_prisonChain.webp","glyph":2,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Prison_Chain","pinyin":"jianyusuolian","initials":"jysl"},{"id":"addon:the_redeemer:bayshore_s_cigar","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-19","title":"贝索的雪茄烟","titleEn":null,"rarity":"very-rare","description":["从凯勒布老板的口袋里抽出的高品质雪茄，当时老板正因为腹部被矛枪刺穿而不停惨叫。","·逃生者挣脱矛枪后的击晕时间减少0.75秒。"],"flavor":"“别用那玩意儿指着我，你这白痴懒鬼。”——亨利·贝索","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_bayshoresCigar.webp","glyph":3,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Bayshore%27s_Cigar","pinyin":"beisuodexueqieyan","initials":"bsdxqy"},{"id":"addon:the_redeemer:gold_creek_whiskey","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-19","title":"金溪威士忌","titleEn":null,"rarity":"very-rare","description":["凯勒布借酒浇愁，肚中的暖意暂时平息了他的怒意，他的步履也开始蹒跚。","·救赎者瞄准时的恐惧范围减少8米。"],"flavor":"“酒香浓郁，边境一绝。”——1876年的金溪广告","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_goldCreekWhiskey.webp","glyph":3,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Gold_Creek_Whiskey","pinyin":"jinxiweishiji","initials":"jxwsj"},{"id":"addon:the_redeemer:warden_s_keys","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-19","title":"狱长的钥匙","titleEn":null,"rarity":"rare","description":["钥匙沉闷的叮当声唤起了令凯勒布恼怒的回忆。","·救赎者的装填时间减少0.35秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_wardensKeys.webp","glyph":7,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Warden%27s_Keys","pinyin":"yuchangdeyaoshi","initials":"ycdys"},{"id":"addon:the_redeemer:honey_locust_thorn","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-19","title":"皂荚荆棘","titleEn":null,"rarity":"rare","description":["凯勒布因两次都没抓住一个悬赏目标而怒不可遏，他把荆棘拧在矛头上并射了出去。","·挣脱矛枪的逃生者会受到重伤状态影响，持续70秒。","重伤状态会使治疗所需时间增加25%，该效果会持续一段时间，或直至被完全治疗。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_honeyLocustThorn.webp","glyph":3,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Honey_Locust_Thorn","pinyin":"zaojiajingji","initials":"zjjj"},{"id":"addon:the_redeemer:bayshore_s_gold_tooth","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-19","title":"贝索的金牙","titleEn":null,"rarity":"rare","description":["从哭喊求饶的亨利·贝索口中拔出的金牙。几小时后，他被结束了生命。","· 救赎者收线速度增加5%。"],"flavor":"“小子，人要有自知之明。要有自知之明啊。”——亨利·贝索","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_bayshoresGoldTooth.webp","glyph":0,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Bayshore%27s_Gold_Tooth","pinyin":"beisuodejinya","initials":"bsdjy"},{"id":"addon:the_redeemer:wanted_poster","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-19","title":"通缉告示","titleEn":null,"rarity":"rare","description":["破烂发黄的梅森·凯利通缉告示。令凯勒布专心追捕犯人。","·救赎者瞄准时的移动速度增加3%。"],"flavor":"“我在我母亲的坟前起誓，一定会对你严惩不贷。”——凯勒布·奎因","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_wantedPoster.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":0.95,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Wanted_Poster","pinyin":"tongjigaoshi","initials":"tjgs"},{"id":"addon:the_redeemer:tin_oil_can","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-19","title":"锡制油罐","titleEn":null,"rarity":"rare","description":["罐子装着少量用来润滑机械的油。旧型的矛枪因为有经常卡壳的毛病而名声很差，因此必须时刻准备好润滑油。","·救赎者落空后的冷却时间减少0.5秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_tinOilCan.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Tin_Oil_Can","pinyin":"xizhiyouguan","initials":"xzyg"},{"id":"addon:the_redeemer:jaw_smasher","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-19","title":"下颌粉碎者","titleEn":null,"rarity":"uncommon","description":["在激烈交火中射穿凯勒布下颌的子弹。它点燃了他熊熊的复仇之火。","· 救赎者瞄准时的移动速度增加1.5%。"],"flavor":"“从你和我过不去的那一刻起，死神就已经盯上你了。” --凯勒布·奎因","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_jawSmasher.webp","glyph":7,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Jaw_Smasher","pinyin":"xiahefensuizhe","initials":"xhfsz"},{"id":"addon:the_redeemer:chewing_tobacco","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-19","title":"嚼用烟草","titleEn":null,"rarity":"uncommon","description":["一罐切割好的甜烟叶，是从格伦威尔的一具被开膛破肚的尸体上偷来的。对神经系统有刺激作用。","· 逃生者挣脱矛枪后的击晕时间减少0.25秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_chewingTobacco.webp","glyph":0,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Chewing_Tobacco","pinyin":"jiaoyongyancao","initials":"jyyc"},{"id":"addon:the_redeemer:marshal_s_badge","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-19","title":"执法官徽章","titleEn":null,"rarity":"uncommon","description":["从亚利桑那地区一名插手地狱郡黑帮赏金的执法者尸体上摘下的银质徽章。","·救赎者瞄准时的恐惧范围减少4米。"],"flavor":"“趁现在赶快祈祷吧，到中午你就要被吊死了。”——凯勒布·奎因","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_marshalsBadge.webp","glyph":5,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Marshal%27s_Badge","pinyin":"zhifaguanhuizhang","initials":"zfghz"},{"id":"addon:the_redeemer:poison_oak_leaves","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-19","title":"毒栎叶","titleEn":null,"rarity":"uncommon","description":["一株看似普通的植物，凯勒布发现浸过它榨出的油后，矛枪所造成的伤口周围会长出让人疼痛难忍的水疱。","·逃生者缝合时间增加1.5秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_poisonOakLeaves.webp","glyph":0,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Poison_Oak_Leaves","pinyin":"duliye","initials":"dly"},{"id":"addon:the_redeemer:rusted_spike","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-19","title":"生锈尖钉","titleEn":null,"rarity":"uncommon","description":["凯勒布在一时好奇心的驱使下，将铁路道钉绑在了矛枪的前端。并不尖锐的尖端导致其无法干净利落地刺穿目标。","·使用救赎者收线拉回逃生者时命中该逃生者，会对其施加重伤状态，持续60秒。","重伤状态会使治疗所需时间增加25%，该效果会持续一段时间，或直至被完全治疗。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_rustedSpike.webp","glyph":5,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Rusted_Spike","pinyin":"shengxiujianding","initials":"sxjd"},{"id":"addon:the_redeemer:spit_polish_rag","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-19","title":"唾沫抹布","titleEn":null,"rarity":"common","description":["一块粗糙的抹布。在激烈的交火中，吐一口唾沫用力擦拭便足以把矛枪擦干净。","· 救赎者落空后的冷却时间减少0.25秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_spitPolishRag.webp","glyph":0,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Spit_Polish_Rag","pinyin":"tuomomabu","initials":"tmmb"},{"id":"addon:the_redeemer:modified_ammo_belt","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-19","title":"改装过的弹药带","titleEn":null,"rarity":"common","description":["由于凯勒布使用的是特种武器，他对这条旧弹药带进行了改装。上面还残留着亚利桑那疆界沙漠的红色细沙。","·救赎者装填时间减少0.25秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_modifiedAmmoBelt.webp","glyph":7,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Modified_Ammo_Belt","pinyin":"gaizhuangguodedanyaodai","initials":"gzgddyd"},{"id":"addon:the_redeemer:rickety_chain","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-19","title":"易断锁链","titleEn":null,"rarity":"common","description":["脆弱的铁链，一开始装在凯勒布的原型矛枪上。尽管这条锁链并不牢靠，但很有纪念价值。","·刺中得分事件获得50%额外血点。","·逃生者挣脱速度增加33%。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_ricketyChain.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Rickety_Chain","pinyin":"yiduansuolian","initials":"ydsl"},{"id":"addon:the_redeemer:snake_oil","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-19","title":"蛇油","titleEn":null,"rarity":"common","description":["从旅行商人手中买到的少量油性提取物。号称能治百病。","· 救赎者收线速度增加2.5%。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_snakeOil.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Snake_Oil","pinyin":"sheyou","initials":"sy"}]
